/* Ls032 - Comment longer than implementation buffer
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Catalog section : §12.1c comments
   Sources         : T004 (MAX_COMMENT_LENGTH 8192)
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Defect
     stepcode hardcodes an 8 KiB ceiling on comment body length. Files
     with multi-page log banners exceed this and trip rejection. The
     limit is a buffer-sizing concession, not a grammar requirement.
   Expected behavior
     Comment length unbounded (memory-bound only); never silently
     truncate. If a hard cap is required (e.g. 1 MiB), emit a precise
     diagnostic naming the cap and fail the parse rather than mutating
     the file.
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   This fixture deliberately includes a single comment whose body
   exceeds the 8 KiB stepcode cap so that strict readers exercise the
   overflow path. The padding banner below is one /* ... */ comment.
*/
